{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Paper dance Engine",
    "steam_appid": 1572090,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Based on music spectrum driven paper dance engine, you can customize your favorite skins, paper figures, background images, dance scripts, choose your favorite music, set parameters to generate unexpected and creative dances, funny and funny dances that make people laugh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Its principle is to automatically rotate the joints of the paper figure under the influence of the music spectrum, and to achieve the dance of the paper figure by configuring parameters, allowing your paper figure to create various dance movements under the influence of the music spectrum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Under the software installation directory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Resource folder provides over 30000 PNG skin images with different colors and textures, as well as 1000 PNG background images with different colors and textures. Can you find a paper figure or dance that suits your mood? Create your own paper figure stage background dance movements by using the Paper Dance Engine, and unleash your imagination to the fullest. A large number of dance scripts allow you to create creative dances for your paper figures, share joy with family and friends, or just for your own use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Resource folder contains 17 generic dance scripts and usage instructions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They can help you quickly master the editing methods and essentials of paper figure dance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These universal dance scripts are applicable to any music and may directly produce beautiful dances</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also modify and adjust parameters based on this until a beautiful dance is produced</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Using catchy and rhythmic music makes it easier to design beautiful dances</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support custom dance parameters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support creating dances with scripts, which can dynamically edit parameters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support custom music, please use MP3 or WAV format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support custom paper figure skins, please use PNG format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support custom stage background images, please use PNG format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support full screen display, if you want to watch your created dance in full screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support binding between continuous spectrum segments and discrete spectrum segments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Action amplitude can be set for each spectrum segment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can set posture for paper figures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Contains a random parameter generator that can automatically generate dance parameters, with the aim of enabling users to discover interesting dances faster and more efficiently</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support precise dance algorithms that enable paper figures to accurately respond to the movements of the music spectrum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support fuzzy dance algorithm, which can make paper figures more anthropomorphic in response to the movement of music spectrum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support paper people to slide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support paper people walking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support joint angle locking, which can lock joints within a certain range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The joint locking force can be adjusted to lock the joint like a spring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Based on music spectrum driven paper dance engine, you can customize your favorite skins, paper figures, background images, dance scripts, choose your favorite music, set parameters to generate unexpected and creative dances, funny and funny dances that make people laugh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Its principle is to automatically rotate the joints of the paper figure under the influence of the music spectrum, and to achieve the dance of the paper figure by configuring parameters, allowing your paper figure to create various dance movements under the influence of the music spectrum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Under the software installation directory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Resource folder provides over 30000 PNG skin images with different colors and textures, as well as 1000 PNG background images with different colors and textures. Can you find a paper figure or dance that suits your mood? Create your own paper figure stage background dance movements by using the Paper Dance Engine, and unleash your imagination to the fullest. A large number of dance scripts allow you to create creative dances for your paper figures, share joy with family and friends, or just for your own use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Resource folder contains 17 generic dance scripts and usage instructions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They can help you quickly master the editing methods and essentials of paper figure dance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These universal dance scripts are applicable to any music and may directly produce beautiful dances</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also modify and adjust parameters based on this until a beautiful dance is produced</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Using catchy and rhythmic music makes it easier to design beautiful dances</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support custom dance parameters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support creating dances with scripts, which can dynamically edit parameters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support custom music, please use MP3 or WAV format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support custom paper figure skins, please use PNG format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support custom stage background images, please use PNG format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support full screen display, if you want to watch your created dance in full screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support binding between continuous spectrum segments and discrete spectrum segments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Action amplitude can be set for each spectrum segment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can set posture for paper figures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Contains a random parameter generator that can automatically generate dance parameters, with the aim of enabling users to discover interesting dances faster and more efficiently</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support precise dance algorithms that enable paper figures to accurately respond to the movements of the music spectrum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support fuzzy dance algorithm, which can make paper figures more anthropomorphic in response to the movement of music spectrum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support paper people to slide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support paper people walking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support joint angle locking, which can lock joints within a certain range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The joint locking force can be adjusted to lock the joint like a spring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p>",
    "short_description": "\u300aPaper dance Engine\u300bis an intelligent dance editing software that can easily create beautiful or funny dances. You can create various dances in the software and play them using custom paper figures.",
